# Date editor: natural-language input with a live calendar
Output "03-date.gif"
Source "../tapes/_setup.tape"
Sleep 800ms
Right 8
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Ctrl+U
Type "fri"
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot "raw/tui-03-date.png"
Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+U
Type "+3w"
Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+U
Type "eom"
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Escape
Sleep 500ms
